chor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11},{"id":"wgc-q0109","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a60df5631c12b6021cc3","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“是时，当世俊士散骑常侍夏侯玄、尚书诸葛诞、邓飏之徒，共相题表，以玄（畴）〔等〕四人为‘四聪’，诞（备）〔辈〕八人为‘八达’。中书监刘放子熙、孙资子密、吏部尚书卫臻子烈三人，咸不及比；以父居势位，容之为‘三豫’：凡十五人。帝以构长浮华，皆免官废锢。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-755a241ddb9f85f85b2a","start":0,"end":134},{"id":"wgc-q0581","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a60df5631c12b6021cc3","layer":"pei","quote":"帝以构长浮华，皆免官废锢","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-755a241ddb9f85f85b2a","start":120,"end":132}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
